## BoardsApi

### Create board section
## Create board section
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}/sections?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "id": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>"
}


### Delete board section
## Delete board section
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}/sections/{{section_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### List board sections
## List board sections
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}/sections?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### List Pins on board section
## List Pins on board section
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}/sections/{{section_id}}/pins?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Update board section
## Update board section
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}/sections/{{section_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "id": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>"
}


### Create board
## Create board
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "description": "<string>",
 "is_ads_only": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "privacy": "<string>"
}


### Delete board
## Delete board
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get board
## Get board
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### List boards
## List boards
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&privacy={{privacy}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### List Pins on board
## List Pins on board
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}/pins?creativeTypes={{creativeTypes}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&pinMetrics={{pinMetrics}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Update board
## Update board
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/boards/{{board_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "description": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "privacy": "<string>"
}

